Re-hash every imported look and report missing or changed files

Usage: ym looks verify [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -q, --quiet    Print only errors on stderr
  -v, --verbose  Print what is happening on stderr: stages, timings and notes
  -h, --help     Print help
